AB  - Connoisseur is an advanced process control package. It makes possible tight control of the process using existing interfaces to the plant instrumentation and in addition it provides the functionality of a full feature SCADA system. Two particular applications of Connoisseur in the food industry, the dried milk powder production and the pH control in a sugar industry, are presented.<>
